  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A plane passing through the line of intersection of the given <math><mn>2</mn></math> planes is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Since the given line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> must lie in this plane<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />The point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> must satisfy the equation of the plane<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Solving <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></math></p>"
  }
